   1085  27d5							;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1086  27d5							; Enemies: half of them each frame (even slots on even frames, odd slots on
   1087  27d5							; odd frames), so each moves in steps of two frames. Each walks left at its
   1088  27d5							; kind's pace; a toy in its way stops it and gets chewed, except: the
   1089  27d5							; helicopter hops over the first toy, the pogo frog jumps to the next shelf
   1090  27d5							; once, the balloon clown floats over every toy, the T-Rex crushes a toy in
   1091  27d5							; one bite. A jack-in-the-box springs on whatever reaches it; reaching the
   1092  27d5							; toy box is a breach.
   1093  27d5				   Enemies
